2. Free personal beta testing

An individual may download, install, run and make reasonable private backup
copies of lawfully supplied Mixworks Alloy beta versions, free of charge, solely
for personal, non-commercial testing, evaluation and learning. Private hobby
mixes for that testing are permitted. You may read the original source and make
private changes and private builds for the same purpose, subject to each
dependency's licence. You may report bugs and share your own screenshots,
demonstrations and test feedback without including source code or third-party
music you are not entitled to share. No payment, activation service or automatic
expiry is imposed by this licence on a lawfully supplied beta version.

